<h1>Windows sign-out</h1>
<div class="scaffold-card">
    <p>This portal uses Windows Negotiate authentication and does not create an application session to terminate.</p>
    <p>To use another account, end or change the browser and operating-system Windows session according to your host policy.</p>
</div>
